{"id":"wb-6-521","name":"户部山古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"户部山古建筑群","text":"户部山古建筑群位于中国江苏省徐州市云龙区户部山周围，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n户部山原名南山，明天启四年（1624年）黄河决堤，徐州户部分司署避水迁至此处，故而得名。户部山周围地势较高，明清两代富户争相在此购地建房。现存较完整的民居院落十三个，共五百余间。保存较好的有郑家大院、翟家大院、余家大院、刘家大院、李家大楼、崔焘翰林府、李蟠状元府、魏家园、老盐店等。其中余家大院和翟家大院已辟为徐州民俗博物馆。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%88%B7%E9%83%A8%E5%B1%B1%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":92133448,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92133448","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4e12ded8df3b0b03486ee57e.jpg","title":"20260201_Ancient_Buildings_at_Hubushan_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260201_Ancient_Buildings_at_Hubushan_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/20260201_Ancient_Buildings_at_Hubushan_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​徐州 户部山古建筑群","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}